    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkolong'i e nkiting'oto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tayiolo ena nchere ore too nkolong'i e nkiting'oto naa kepuonu nkatitin oo sinaitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu keaku iltung'ana iloonyor ate, iloonyor mpesai, iloowuasa, ilooilash, iloomorisho, iloogolong'aki ntoiwuo enye, ilemeeta ashe, nemeure Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iloorook oishuaa, ilemesayiayu, nekurrisho, nemeeta esupatisho, ilemeibooyo ate too ntorrok pushunot, ilooiba esupatisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilooudoo ilkulenye, neipopong'a to lwuasa, iloonyor esikar alang enanyor Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oitaakuno kenyor Enkai netanyaita engolon enye. Talama iyie iltung'ana ooikununo neijia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ti atua ninche netii lelo ooruk nkajijik, neibung nena kituaak naamoda naanapita lolan loo ng'ok naarikito ng'uarrat enye oo mpukunot kumok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naainining pooki ng'ae nemebaiki aikata eyiolounoto e ina sipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 7.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Anaa Yanes o Yampres ootanyaita enatejo Musa, neijia sii etiu kulo tung'ana ootanyaita esipata, iltung'ana ootarruoitie ndamunot ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake meeta dikai nebaya ilenkirukoto e nkitaakuno amu keibalayu emodai enye te pooki anaa ene lelo tung'ana apa pokira oare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkiteng'enat naabayie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake indipa iyie atoduaa enkiteng'enare ai o rrekie lai o enaipirta te nkishui ai enkirukoto ai, eng'iriata ai, enyorrata ai, o enkitashoto ai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.14+ACT.13.15+ACT.13.16+ACT.13.17+ACT.13.18+ACT.13.19+ACT.13.20+ACT.13.21+ACT.13.22+ACT.13.23+ACT.13.24+ACT.13.25+ACT.13.26+ACT.13.27+ACT.13.28+ACT.13.29+ACT.13.30+ACT.13.31+ACT.13.32+ACT.13.33+ACT.13.34+ACT.13.35+ACT.13.36+ACT.13.37+ACT.13.38+ACT.13.39+ACT.13.40+ACT.13.41+ACT.13.42+ACT.13.43+ACT.13.44+ACT.13.45+ACT.13.46+ACT.13.47+ACT.13.48+ACT.13.49+ACT.13.50+ACT.13.51+ACT.13.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 13.14-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.1+ACT.14.2+ACT.14.3+ACT.14.4+ACT.14.5+ACT.14.6+ACT.14.7+ACT.14.8+ACT.14.9+ACT.14.10+ACT.14.11+ACT.14.12+ACT.14.13+ACT.14.14+ACT.14.15+ACT.14.16+ACT.14.17+ACT.14.18+ACT.14.19+ACT.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " inkisilisilot aainei, sinaitin laainei, nena naaineputua te Antiok, te Ikonio o te Listra, eneba inkisilisilot nating'iria nanu; kake ore te nena pooki naatokordua Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esipa ore lelo pooki ooyieu neibung orrekie le Enkai ti atua Kristo Yesu, nemeeta nchere pee meisilisili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore kuldo tung'ana torrok o lalejak neponari aaku torrok, elejisho neleji sii ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore iyie, tobiko te nena nindipa atayiolo aitisip, amu iyiolo iyie ajo aing'ae likinteng'ena ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ebaiki keraisho ino itayiolo lelo kigerot sinyat likindim aaiteng'ena te njeunoto naimu enkirukoto ti atua Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkigerot pooki naa Enkai naiyiang'ua, neeta dupoto te nkiteng'enare, o te nkisikong'at o ererioto, o te nkitubulunoto ti atua esupatisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paa ore oltung'ani le Enkai neitabari te nkiaas pooki sidai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
